{
  "id": "its-always-sunny-in-philadelphia---9x09---the-gang-makes-lethal-weapon-6",
  "title": "It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia - 9x09 - The Gang Makes Lethal Weapon 6",
  "sourceFilename": "It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia - 9x09 - The Gang Makes Lethal Weapon 6.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-20T06:02:03.862Z",
  "lineCount": 272,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "♪ Bah-hoo-yeah Bah-hoo-yeah",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 14866,
      "endMs": 20000
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Bah-hoo-yeah Bah-hoo-yeah. ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 20503,
      "endMs": 24069
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Welcome back from the dead, Chief Lazarus!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 27904,
      "endMs": 33351
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "I only got one thing on my mind.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 35019,
      "endMs": 38966
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Revenge!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 39649,
      "endMs": 41458
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "What exactly are you here for?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 56388,
      "endMs": 58258
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "We need $40 million.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 58546,
      "endMs": 60954
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Sync & corrections by honeybunny www.addic7ed.com Resync for WEB-DL by Norther",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 72161,
      "endMs": 82161
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "So we've shot a great deal of the movie, and we're gonna show it to you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 84915,
      "endMs": 88280
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "We just need a little money to finish it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 88305,
      "endMs": 89931
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Yeah, see, we had a little bit of a falling out with our financier.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 89955,
      "endMs": 92282
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "He's also playing Chief Lazarus.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 92294,
      "endMs": 93750
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Just, we had some creative differences with him, you know, which is why we're coming to you, but, look, that's neither here nor there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 93776,
      "endMs": 98410
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "The guy wanted to shoot a full penetration sex scene and show it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 98444,
      "endMs": 101088
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "But, to be fair, I don't have a problem, as much, with the act itself",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 101100,
      "endMs": 104775
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "as I do with the man who's performing it. Don't get into that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 104794,
      "endMs": 106528
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "It's, like, more specific than she needs to... - Let her know. I think she...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 106542,
      "endMs": 108392
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Look, I just, I think that no one wants to see Frank smashing genitalia with a woman, but if it were me doing it, you know, imagine that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 108417,
      "endMs": 114489
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Wouldn't that be nice? Imagine all the positions that I could get into.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 114518,
      "endMs": 117777
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "You know, reverse pile driver, seated scissors, wheelbarrow, reverse cowgirl.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 117795,
      "endMs": 121970
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "I know all the positions. Whatever you like. - He can do 'em all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 121982,
      "endMs": 124294
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "I can do 'em all, yeah. He can do 'em all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 124313,
      "endMs": 125737
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "So imagine that. Do you see the difference?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 125756,
      "endMs": 127783
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "We don't finance movies here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 128531,
      "endMs": 130690
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Let's show her more of the movie. Get into the story a little bit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 130721,
      "endMs": 133036
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Okay, that's exactly right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133060,
      "endMs": 134524
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Keep watching, and then see the big picture, know that there are budgetary and time limitations and ignore them, please.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 134552,
      "endMs": 140515
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 140537,
      "endMs": 141736
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "In your face, sucker.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 153256,
      "endMs": 155151
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Oh, shit!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 163220,
      "endMs": 165687
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Riggs, what the hell are you doing here?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 176173,
      "endMs": 179518
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Our relationship is strained.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 179602,
      "endMs": 181497
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Thought I'd give you some pointers on your jump shot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 181522,
      "endMs": 183705
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Noticed you weren't squaring up on the basket.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 183729,
      "endMs": 186017
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Schooling a black man on basketball. You must be crazy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 188313,
      "endMs": 192357
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Crazy enough to want to know why you never RSVP'd to my wedding.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192379,
      "endMs": 196177
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Gee, do I want to see my ex-special forces ex-partner marry my baby girl daughter?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 199680,
      "endMs": 206878
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Thanks. I respectfully say, \"No.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 207178,
      "endMs": 210287
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "I tell you what, Sarge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 210374,
      "endMs": 212403
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Let's play a quick game of one-on-one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 212646,
      "endMs": 214649
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "You score on me, you don't have to come to the wedding.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 215073,
      "endMs": 218646
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "If I score on you, I don't have to come to the wedding?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 220057,
      "endMs": 223228
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "That's right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 223973,
      "endMs": 225615
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "So all I do is score once, and then I don't come to the wedding?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 226778,
      "endMs": 229093
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 229112,
      "endMs": 230500
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Well, this is gonna be...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 230663,
      "endMs": 232436
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "♪ A slam dunk!",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 232458,
      "endMs": 234475
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Break a leg. Hell, break both of 'em.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 246656,
      "endMs": 250363
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Heavenly Father, we thank you for your glories.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273125,
      "endMs": 276525
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "We also thank Martin for his lovely sax solo in lieu of vows.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276540,
      "endMs": 281670
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Rianne will now recite hers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 281694,
      "endMs": 284513
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "My love, when I look deep in your eyes, I find my own destiny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 284638,
      "endMs": 290763
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "I find that I want to love you for the rest of my days, and I will.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 291205,
      "endMs": 295858
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "I will spend every day of my life trying to make you the happiest man in the whole world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 296155,
      "endMs": 303682
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "That was lovely.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305358,
      "endMs": 307377
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "If anybody has any objection to this union, you speak now, or forever hold your peace.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 308720,
      "endMs": 316816
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "I object. What?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 316884,
      "endMs": 318534
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "I need to do something first-- get your father's blessing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 319864,
      "endMs": 324699
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "I came here for my daughter, not you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 334271,
      "endMs": 337853
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "I love her, Rog.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 337871,
      "endMs": 339856
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Yeah. I know you do, pal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340983,
      "endMs": 344401
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 358829,
      "endMs": 360471
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "I love weddings.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 362042,
      "endMs": 364948
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "They always such a blast!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 365797,
      "endMs": 367986
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh! Got to get out of here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367998,
      "endMs": 370775
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Oh! Oh, let me out of here! Let me out of here! Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 372438,
      "endMs": 376382
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 391991,
      "endMs": 394049
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Um... I don't get why you're making this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404684,
      "endMs": 408124
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Oh, I mean... Oh...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 408334,
      "endMs": 410415
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "God, the bank didn't get it either.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 410433,
      "endMs": 411739
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Why make anything, you know? For the money, for the glory,",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 411751,
      "endMs": 414223
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "for the fame. All-- the whole thing. Absolutely.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 414247,
      "endMs": 415859
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Yeah, and-and clearly the movie's pretty kick-ass right up until we get to the special effects snafu.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 415882,
      "endMs": 420947
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Our ex-backer liked to cut corners, but we feel like, with your technical expertise, being from a dot-com company and all, and your money, we could really make a kick-ass movie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 420972,
      "endMs": 428770
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Yeah, now, the next scene is, um, the next scene is bad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 428794,
      "endMs": 431714
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "The next scene is a little bit of a disaster. - It's got some problems, too, but then, once we get past that, it's pretty good, but let me set this up for you so you're not totally confused.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 431731,
      "endMs": 438428
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Somebody released some kind of a biting bug, the likes of which I've never contended with.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 438453,
      "endMs": 442018
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Frank and I got them from China, and they just went crazy in the bar and bit us up like...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 442043,
      "endMs": 445323
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "What do you mean you \"got them from China\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 445341,
      "endMs": 446673
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "You ordered them? - Don't worry about where we got them or why we were getting them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 446691,
      "endMs": 449359
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Jesus Christ. - We just released them, there was an issue...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 449373,
      "endMs": 450843
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "All right, so you're gonna enjoy this part.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 450871,
      "endMs": 452215
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Go ahead and push play. Yeah, yeah, keep it going.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 452240,
      "endMs": 454436
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Hey, Chief, I'd like to trade in...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 459719,
      "endMs": 462500
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "...these flowers for a badge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 463166,
      "endMs": 465163
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Well, I just happen to have that gun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 465184,
      "endMs": 467535
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Welcome back to the force, Riggs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468657,
      "endMs": 471231
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Murtaugh. Murtaugh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 471360,
      "endMs": 474404
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "It's great that you're a cop again, Rog.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 474672,
      "endMs": 476495
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "We'll n-need it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 476511,
      "endMs": 477873
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Well, I had to come back because they killed my baby girl as you was getting married to her. Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 477898,
      "endMs": 483921
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Looks like I'm not the only cop with a death wish now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 483952,
      "endMs": 486452
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Ha!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 486482,
      "endMs": 488098
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Chief, I think I found some clues.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489084,
      "endMs": 491351
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "What the hell does those things have to do with Chief Lazarus?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 491376,
      "endMs": 494489
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Well, I've got a hunch. Chief, I've got a hunch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 494722,
      "endMs": 497283
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "See, feathers were usually used in Indian resurrection burials,",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 497618,
      "endMs": 501562
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "which could only mean one thing. Damn!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 501603,
      "endMs": 504597
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Well... That Lazarus is back from the dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 504618,
      "endMs": 507180
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Damn!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 507205,
      "endMs": 509039
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "You think?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 509502,
      "endMs": 510918
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "So he's probably planning an elaborate rain dance to drench L.A. so bad that it ends up in the ocean.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 513982,
      "endMs": 520945
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Making his Indian reservation the only thing left standing and very valuable beachfront property.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 520964,
      "endMs": 527248
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "That's could be the only answer. Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 527418,
      "endMs": 529818
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Oh, oh. I'm just gonna fast-forward for a minute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 530876,
      "endMs": 533736
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Uh, but this... Yeah, this is important...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 533761,
      "endMs": 535681
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "I'll, uh, I'll play it here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535707,
      "endMs": 537107
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Beachfront property on his Indian reservation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 537132,
      "endMs": 539846
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "No, you're still going on about the whole... - No, just keep going.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 539871,
      "endMs": 542074
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Yeah... yeah, yeah. - Well, you got to explain every aspect of the movie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 542106,
      "endMs": 544401
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "That's crazy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 544419,
      "endMs": 545621
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Well, that's because when you go to the movies, you know, you can't follow what's going on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 545657,
      "endMs": 549238
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "No, you can't follow what's going on. Yeah, yes, you can.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 549263,
      "endMs": 551138
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "No, no, you're like, \"Who's that guy? Is that the good guy, is that the bad guy?\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 551163,
      "endMs": 553726
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Everybody knows! I'm sorry, guys, um, but maybe it would help if I saw the original Mel Gibson version first.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 553738,
      "endMs": 560416
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "W-What do you mean that you've not seen... - Wha...? How...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 560441,
      "endMs": 562572
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "You've never seen... Lethal Weapon?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 562585,
      "endMs": 564471
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Lethal Weapon? No, I mean, I've heard of it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 564502,
      "endMs": 566552
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "I think what's happening here is the fact that you're a woman,",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 566593,
      "endMs": 568929
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "and our demographic skews male. Well, um...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 568960,
      "endMs": 570788
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "It does-- we are a male- driven, uh, you know...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 570807,
      "endMs": 573509
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "We're a male-driven entity. I-I got, I got that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 573535,
      "endMs": 575641
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Oh, oh, oh, the next scene.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 575666,
      "endMs": 577766
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Oh, yeah, yeah, right, right... Oh, the next scene.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 577791,
      "endMs": 579627
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "That's right, there's stuff for the...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 579658,
      "endMs": 581602
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "the ladies, I guess. Oh, for the ladies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 581631,
      "endMs": 583052
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "This is all for the ladies. You're gonna love this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 583071,
      "endMs": 585265
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Well... yeah. You're gonna dive right in, right here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 585855,
      "endMs": 587842
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "♪ I'd say it was the right time ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 592727,
      "endMs": 595952
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "♪ To walk away ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 596046,
      "endMs": 598461
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "♪ When dreamin' ♪ ♪ takes you nowhere ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 599452,
      "endMs": 602765
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "♪ It's time to play ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 602772,
      "endMs": 605706
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "♪ Bodies workin' overtime ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 606356,
      "endMs": 608884
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "♪ Your money don't matter... ♪ - Yeah...!",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 608901,
      "endMs": 610870
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "♪ Time keeps ticking ♪ ♪ When someone's on my mind ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 610879,
      "endMs": 615461
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "♪ Playing ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 617369,
      "endMs": 619054
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "♪ Playing with the boys ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 619079,
      "endMs": 621783
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "♪ I'm staying ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 624028,
      "endMs": 625651
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "♪ Staying with the boys... ♪",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 625676,
      "endMs": 628695
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 629386,
      "endMs": 631494
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 631888,
      "endMs": 633695
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "All right, blokes, let's hit the showers, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 633720,
      "endMs": 635609
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Yeah. Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 635634,
      "endMs": 636797
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Oh, yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 637864,
      "endMs": 638958
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "I don't know about you, mate, but I'm sore.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 638989,
      "endMs": 641002
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "I'm really sore. I really needed this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 641531,
      "endMs": 644148
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Oh, I needed it, too, mate. All right, buddy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 644173,
      "endMs": 647078
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Now that we know what Lazarus' plan is, what are we gonna do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 647093,
      "endMs": 650370
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "We got to track him down and fight him, you know?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 650986,
      "endMs": 653008
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Sure do.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 653026,
      "endMs": 654239
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "We got to track him down and punch him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654287,
      "endMs": 656179
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "We're gonna track him down and we're gonna... We're gonna go to the strip club, which I'm excited to do.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 656204,
      "endMs": 660474
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "I love strip clubs. Oh, baby, I love me a good strip club.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 660499,
      "endMs": 664365
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "We're gonna... I mean, this is crazy, right? - Wha...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 664394,
      "endMs": 666544
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "I miss her, Riggs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 667434,
      "endMs": 669226
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Nothing's ever gonna make me forget her.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 669663,
      "endMs": 671774
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "I know, buddy. Lazarus has taken everything from us, but we're gonna take what he loves most: his life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 672711,
      "endMs": 681221
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Yeah?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 681257,
      "endMs": 682711
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Well, we'd better do it right this time, baby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 682805,
      "endMs": 685242
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "We ain't getting any younger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 685904,
      "endMs": 687904
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "That's for sure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 687963,
      "endMs": 689326
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "I'm starting to think even I'm getting too old for this shit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 689351,
      "endMs": 691993
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Say what?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 692018,
      "endMs": 693274
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Oh...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 693303,
      "endMs": 694890
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "That's what you always say. I know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 694915,
      "endMs": 696415
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "I brought it back. That's your... Yeah, I got that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 696438,
      "endMs": 698934
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Whoa, shit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 699629,
      "endMs": 701319
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Come here, you rascal. Whoa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 701905,
      "endMs": 703808
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "You want to wrestle, you... You want to go, old man?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 703832,
      "endMs": 706793
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "You young, but you ain't that strong, baby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 706839,
      "endMs": 709041
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "You want to go, old man? You want to go, old man?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 709062,
      "endMs": 711575
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "You too young for this...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 711586,
      "endMs": 712717
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Whoa, whoa, whoa, what is this? What are you showing me here?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 712742,
      "endMs": 715512
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "We're showing you a testosterone-driven, male-skewing action melodrama.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 715531,
      "endMs": 719308
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Yeah, you're gonna love this stuff. And, by the way, as a hedge fund manager, you're used to this kind of high-stakes, adrenaline-pumping action, so this should be perfect for you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 719328,
      "endMs": 726652
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "I'm a little confused. Oh, is it the character-switching?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 726674,
      "endMs": 729455
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "'Cause, just move past that, all right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 729492,
      "endMs": 731308
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Trust me, our audience has come to expect",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 731333,
      "endMs": 733091
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "that kind of thing from us. - No, no, no, I'm confused about what you want.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 733116,
      "endMs": 735522
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Uh, you need money to fund your gay porno movie?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 735563,
      "endMs": 739022
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Oh, goddamn it, Mac. Gay porno movie?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 739047,
      "endMs": 740463
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "What are you talking about? See? See!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 740483,
      "endMs": 741844
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "You even watching the movie? Yes, in a lot of ways",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 741875,
      "endMs": 743813
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "this is a love story between two men. - No, it isn't.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 743832,
      "endMs": 745824
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Okay, yes, in a... most ways. No, it isn't.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 745841,
      "endMs": 747791
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "All right, but this is about as masculine as it gets.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 747811,
      "endMs": 749492
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "It's not, it's not, I mean... No, it isn't, no, it isn't.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 749518,
      "endMs": 751449
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "You had a butt-double. Oh, of course I had a butt-double.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 751478,
      "endMs": 753741
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "You think I'm gonna show my butt on camera, Charlie? - Oh, my God, I was uncomfortable filming the scene.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 753753,
      "endMs": 758400
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "If you play the movie, you'll see..",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 758426,
      "endMs": 760501
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "It gets way straighter, I promise. - Push play, you're gonna love this next part.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760994,
      "endMs": 763987
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "We'll cut that stuff out. See, nobody wants that...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764012,
      "endMs": 766295
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "I sure am glad we came to this strip club, Riggs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 772380,
      "endMs": 775005
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "I do like looking at beautiful naked women.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 775565,
      "endMs": 778138
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "That's because we're not gay. Right, right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 778183,
      "endMs": 780810
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Up next is Lady Starship. She's gonna blow you away with her celestial body.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 780836,
      "endMs": 786177
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Lady Starship-- I like the sound of that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 786209,
      "endMs": 788453
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Man, what the hell! Oh, what the f...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 792812,
      "endMs": 794781
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "That's more like it. Yeah. You like that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 805599,
      "endMs": 808199
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "I do, yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 808224,
      "endMs": 809380
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "What are you looking at, man? Shit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 809403,
      "endMs": 811492
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Frank, will you pay attention, man?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 814394,
      "endMs": 815825
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "I mean, come on, we've been all over town.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 815854,
      "endMs": 817467
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "We went to a hedge fund guy, a dot-com girl, we went to banks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 817492,
      "endMs": 820364
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "No one's gonna fund this thing. No, we need to finish the movie, Frank.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820383,
      "endMs": 823064
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "All right, I'll give you the money. But we do the movie my way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 823088,
      "endMs": 826978
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "I want... what I want. And you know what I want.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 826986,
      "endMs": 830620
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "That's not cool, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 830639,
      "endMs": 831785
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "We can make it work, we'll just have to add some exposition--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 831810,
      "endMs": 834140
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "a whole scene of it. What needs to be explained?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 834171,
      "endMs": 835934
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "It's gonna be perfectly clear! It's gonna be way too clear what's happening.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 835959,
      "endMs": 838820
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Frank, it's gonna ruin the movie, Frank!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 838839,
      "endMs": 840464
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "It's gonna be so confusing...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840492,
      "endMs": 842017
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "It's not gonna be... It's not gonna be confusing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 842041,
      "endMs": 844011
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "We got a deal or what?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 844036,
      "endMs": 846036
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Ah! Damn. Damn! They found us!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 850911,
      "endMs": 854609
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "We got Lazarus trapped in his own umbrella factory. - Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 856407,
      "endMs": 859718
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "He gonna do a rain dance and then make some money on some umbrellas, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 859748,
      "endMs": 863229
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "He a dirty bitch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 863259,
      "endMs": 864931
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Come on, let's go get him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 865083,
      "endMs": 867508
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "I'm gonna jump over this!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 868550,
      "endMs": 870255
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Get over it! I got you, Riggs! Hurry up!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 871483,
      "endMs": 874642
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Oh, I'm getting too old for this shit. Come on, man!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 876845,
      "endMs": 879326
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "We're pinned down, Rog.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882762,
      "endMs": 884570
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "This could be it, good buddy. This could be the end.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 884603,
      "endMs": 888123
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Okay, Rog, if this is the end, we should be the ones to end it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 888159,
      "endMs": 892078
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "You know what? I got this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 892578,
      "endMs": 895007
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "I got that weird Danish twin.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908605,
      "endMs": 910605
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "Oh, shit!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 913563,
      "endMs": 914948
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Aw, damn! He got away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 916976,
      "endMs": 919766
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Oh, hey, you know what?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 920344,
      "endMs": 921959
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "We got to also remember to get that shaman priestess from the beginning.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 921983,
      "endMs": 926437
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "We don't want her bringing him back from the dead... again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 926461,
      "endMs": 931022
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "That's a good point.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 931763,
      "endMs": 933451
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Where's Mac? He's in the bathroom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 933686,
      "endMs": 935528
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Well, that's not gonna work. I mean, we can't...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 935557,
      "endMs": 937557
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "It's fine, just go, let's go. He's in the bathroom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 937584,
      "endMs": 940284
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "He's in the bathroom. - Charlie, it's not... we can't... I mean, it's...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 940520,
      "endMs": 943183
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Oh, shit! Rog, I'm out of bullets!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 951079,
      "endMs": 952938
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "You are? Oh, I'm out of bullets, too, Riggs. Oh, no!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 952957,
      "endMs": 957074
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Time to kiss L.A. good-bye, suckers!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 957395,
      "endMs": 961888
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "'Cause tonight the forecast calls for rain!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961916,
      "endMs": 968433
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Riggs, there's a basketball right there. You should use it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 969710,
      "endMs": 972771
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "I know. Wha... Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 972790,
      "endMs": 975660
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Oh, shit, Rog.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 976023,
      "endMs": 977746
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "If you make this shot, you will have redeemed yourself with the item that you failed with in the beginning.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 977771,
      "endMs": 982253
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "That is right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982278,
      "endMs": 983824
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "I can do it, Riggs. : Ho-ho-ho-ho.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 983935,
      "endMs": 987736
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "In your face, sucker.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 987879,
      "endMs": 990737
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Yeah, buddy, you did it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1004281,
      "endMs": 1006309
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "You did exactly what you said you were gonna do, and now he's dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1006659,
      "endMs": 1009718
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "And now we have to kill that shaman woman so that she doesn't come back and reanimate him again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1009743,
      "endMs": 1014324
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "Wait. I got a better idea first.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1014619,
      "endMs": 1018776
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "What is it? Let me just show you, man, will you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1018868,
      "endMs": 1021420
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "We don't have to say everything, man. Shit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1021445,
      "endMs": 1023542
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "You know you always have my blessin', partner.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1030178,
      "endMs": 1033723
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "That's my partner right there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1036385,
      "endMs": 1038491
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Yeah. And that's a callback.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1039111,
      "endMs": 1041698
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "From the beginning-- so it's come full circle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1041733,
      "endMs": 1043861
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "We know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1043891,
      "endMs": 1044745
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "And then we brought you back from the dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1044770,
      "endMs": 1047001
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Well, the shaman did it. And then we killed her.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1047138,
      "endMs": 1050420
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Because we didn't want her to bring back Lazarus. - Okay. We get it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1051225,
      "endMs": 1055240
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Go ahead. Kiss her.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1055265,
      "endMs": 1057964
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Kiss her, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1060647,
      "endMs": 1062347
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1063605,
      "endMs": 1065172
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Come on, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1066358,
      "endMs": 1068183
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "One last thing, in case I die.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1092495,
      "endMs": 1096935
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "Oh, my God! Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1109021,
      "endMs": 1111021
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "S-So again, this is what we were trying to avoid by coming to you in the first place.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1115479,
      "endMs": 1120764
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1120789,
      "endMs": 1122086
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "Sync & corrections by honeybunny www.addic7ed.com Resync for WEB-DL by Norther",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126699,
      "endMs": 1136699
    }
